PE 779: Prime factor and exponent / 质因子与指数

=== Prime factorization examples ===
  1 =   [Ω=0, ω=0]
  2 = 2  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  3 = 3  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  4 = 2^2  [Ω=2, ω=1]
  5 = 5  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  6 = 2 × 3  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  7 = 7  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  8 = 2^3  [Ω=3, ω=1]
  9 = 3^2  [Ω=2, ω=1]
  10 = 2 × 5  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  11 = 11  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  12 = 2^2 × 3  [Ω=3, ω=2]
  13 = 13  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  14 = 2 × 7  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  15 = 3 × 5  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  16 = 2^4  [Ω=4, ω=1]
  17 = 17  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  18 = 2 × 3^2  [Ω=3, ω=2]
  19 = 19  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  20 = 2^2 × 5  [Ω=3, ω=2]
  21 = 3 × 7  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  22 = 2 × 11  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  23 = 23  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  24 = 2^3 × 3  [Ω=4, ω=2]
  25 = 5^2  [Ω=2, ω=1]
  26 = 2 × 13  [Ω=2, ω=2]
  27 = 3^3  [Ω=3, ω=1]
  28 = 2^2 × 7  [Ω=3, ω=2]
  29 = 29  [Ω=1, ω=1]
  30 = 2 × 3 × 5  [Ω=3, ω=3]

=== Ω(n) and ω(n) statistics ===
Average values for n=1..N:
  N=100: avg Ω(n)=2.3900, avg ω(n)=1.7100, ratio=0.7155
  N=1000: avg Ω(n)=2.8770, avg ω(n)=2.1260, ratio=0.7390
  N=10000: avg Ω(n)=3.1985, avg ω(n)=2.4300, ratio=0.7597
  N=100000: avg Ω(n)=3.4361, avg ω(n)=2.6640, ratio=0.7753

=== Liouville function statistics ===
  L(x) = Σ_{n≤x} λ(n):
    L(100) = -2 (normalized: -0.0200)
    L(500) = -20 (normalized: -0.0400)
    L(1000) = -14 (normalized: -0.0140)
    L(5000) = -46 (normalized: -0.0092)
    L(10000) = -94 (normalized: -0.0094)

=== Density of squarefree numbers ===
  N=100: density=0.610000 (limit: 6/π² = 0.607927)
  N=1000: density=0.608000 (limit: 6/π² = 0.607927)
  N=10000: density=0.608300 (limit: 6/π² = 0.607927)
  N=100000: density=0.607940 (limit: 6/π² = 0.607927)
